cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "rsfec: systematic Reed-Solomon erasure coding over GF(256)"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Tishkov
    given-names: Denis
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-09-28
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/tishden/rs-fec"
abstract: >-
  Header-only C++17 systematic Reed-Solomon (Cauchy) erasure code over
  GF(256) for low-latency packet streams, with runtime-dispatched SIMD
  kernels from SSSE3 to GFNI/AVX-512, interleaving for burst tolerance,
  and a deterministic Gilbert-Elliott loss model for reproducible
  experiments.
keywords:
  - forward error correction
  - erasure coding
  - Reed-Solomon
  - Cauchy matrix
  - GF(256)
  - GFNI
  - SIMD
